{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e848f2c52eb3a1a5","name":"Destruction","source":{"id":"source:reference-e848f2c52eb3a1a5","title":"Destruction","revision":18099,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:35:17Z","sha256":"76ef24c8af82e740ec7616d3eca38af86ec7724e5c597d01c03af643c82f4b6f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18099","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Destruction&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e848f2c52eb3a1a5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," is to destroy a person or object, for good or evil. A Rebel Agent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," might be to destroy a tyrannical Imperial Moff presiding over their home planet, while a darksider may be destined to destroy a powerful Jedi training site used to bolster the ranks of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". The target of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," should be something very difficult to reach, either because it's heavily guarded or well hidden.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Examples of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," include Darth Vader's destruction of the Emperor, Lando Calrissian's destruction of the Death Star II, or A-Wing pilot Arvel Crynyd's destruction of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Executor"]},". A member of the fragmented Galactic Alliance might target a specific Imperial ship or commander involved in a previous battle against them. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," could target ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," in retaliation for sabotaging their terraforming efforts. A Jedi or Imperial Knight might seek to destroy a specific Sith Lord.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Bonus:"]}," For 24 hours, you and any allies within 10 squares of you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus on all damage rolls."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Penalty:"]}," You take a -2 penalty on all damage rolls for 24 hours."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Fulfilled:"]}," Increase one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Score"}," of your choice by +2."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
